# The menu photographs a development server stores (MenuImages:Path is
# data/menu-images, relative to the server project; Windows folds it into Data).
# The shipped photographs are embedded from Data/Seed/MenuImages instead.
src/CallCenter.Server/[Dd]ata/menu-images/

